{
  "id": "contains-duplicate",
  "order": 12,
  "title": "Contains Duplicate",
  "difficulty": "Easy",
  "pattern": "Hash set",
  "statement": "Given an integer array `nums`, return `true` if any value appears at least twice, and `false` if every element is distinct.",
  "constraints": [
    "1 <= nums.length <= 10^5",
    "-10^9 <= nums[i] <= 10^9"
  ],
  "function": {
    "name": "containsDuplicate",
    "params": [
      {
        "name": "nums",
        "type": "int[]"
      }
    ],
    "returns": "bool"
  },
  "complexity": {
    "time": "O(n)",
    "space": "O(n)"
  },
  "hints": [
    "Comparing every pair is O(n^2). What could remember values you have already seen?",
    "A hash set gives O(1) average membership checks.",
    "Insert each value into a set; if it is already present, return true. Sorting and checking neighbours is the O(1)-extra-space alternative."
  ],
  "tests": [
    {
      "args": [
        [
          1,
          2,
          3,
          1
        ]
      ],
      "expected": true,
      "hidden": false,
      "explanation": "1 appears twice."
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          1,
          2,
          3,
          4
        ]
      ],
      "expected": false,
      "hidden": false,
      "explanation": "All distinct."
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          1,
          1,
          1,
          3,
          3,
          4,
          3,
          2,
          4,
          2
        ]
      ],
      "expected": true,
      "hidden": false,
      "explanation": "Many repeats."
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          5
        ]
      ],
      "expected": false,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          0,
          0
        ]
      ],
      "expected": true,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          -1,
          1
        ]
      ],
      "expected": false,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          1000000000,
          -1000000000,
          1000000000
        ]
      ],
      "expected": true,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          52,
          -4,
          -31,
          36,
          -81,
          -5,
          50,
          44,
          -7
        ]
      ],
      "expected": false,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          -63,
          -5,
          54,
          -24,
          -31,
          -6,
          8,
          42
        ]
      ],
      "expected": false,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          18,
          -7,
          3,
          12,
          -9
        ]
      ],
      "expected": false,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          8,
          75,
          13,
          -100
        ]
      ],
      "expected": false,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          96,
          28,
          -29,
          56,
          17
        ]
      ],
      "expected": false,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          19,
          -9,
          -15,
          -3,
          13,
          -20,
          -20,
          -17,
          11,
          -20,
          -7,
          5
        ]
      ],
      "expected": true,
      "hidden": true
    }
  ]
}
